;;; FRECHET SPACES (Proposition 5.2) and H(U) CLOSED IN C(U) (Proposition 5.3).
;;; Agent CA-5, 2026-10-14.  Vocabulary: structure-library/ca5-function-spaces.scm
;;; (CC-CONT-FNS, CC-HOL-FNS, CC-FN-MODULE, CC-EXHAUST-SEMINORMS); the Frechet vocabulary is
;;; structure-library/frechet-open-mapping.scm (IS-SEMINORM-FAMILY, IS-FRECHET-STRUCTURE, FR-CAUCHY,
;;; FR-CONV), the field CC-NORMED-FIELD, the scalars its ring view NFCR(CC-NORMED-FIELD).
;;;
;;; CONTENTS.  For u open in CC, C(u) = CC-CONT-FNS(u), M = CC-FN-MODULE(u, C(u)) (pointwise
;;; operations), p = CC-EXHAUST-SEMINORMS(u, C(u)) (p_k(f) = sup over K_k of |f|):
;;;   cc-scalar-ring-*            the six slots of NFCR(CC-NORMED-FIELD) read off
;;;   cc-fn-module-*              the six slots of CC-FN-MODULE(u, v) read off
;;;   cc-cont-fns-*               C(u) is a set and closed under +, 0, -, scalars, differences
;;;   cc-fn-vadd-*, cc-fn-act-*   the module laws, pointwise
;;;   cc-fn-module-is-module      IS-MODULE(M)
;;;   cc-exhaust-seminorm-subadditive / -homogeneous, cc-exhaust-seminorms-separate
;;;   cc-exhaust-seminorms-family IS-SEMINORM-FAMILY(CC-NORMED-FIELD, M, p)
;;;   cc-fn-module-cauchy-uniform, -pointwise-limit, -limit-function, -limit-uniform,
;;;   cc-uniform-limit-continuous-at   completeness, by the pointwise limit (CHOICE of the limit)
;;;   cc-cont-fns-frechet         PROPOSITION 5.2: IS-FRECHET-STRUCTURE(CC-NORMED-FIELD, M, p)
;;;   cc-hol-fns-subset-cont, cc-hol-fns-closed   PROPOSITION 5.3: H(u) subset C(u), and an
;;;                               FR-CONV limit in C(u) of members of H(u) is in H(u)
;;;                               (from CA-AC's holomorphic-limit-on-compacta, Prop 3.44)
;;; NOTHING asserted.  Every qed modulo 0 (probe worker-06, R4 keep-going band, 2026-10-14).
